1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,911
Sunnydaze Mall: where every day is filled with sunshine and joy.

2
00:00:03,911 --> 00:00:04,588
Until today.

3
00:00:04,808 --> 00:00:06,557
Here's how the location plays.

4
00:00:07,367 --> 00:00:11,697
Put the Savior, the orange Special Victim meeple, on the space the Setup card shows.

5
00:00:11,917 --> 00:00:15,985
Put his Ally card in your play area with four Health markers and four Action cubes,

6
00:00:15,985 --> 00:00:19,661
and his Trust card beside it with the marker on the bottom row, Go to Hell!

7
00:00:19,881 --> 00:00:24,003
Shuffle the Savior cards into a deck, add the Build Trust cards to the Tableau, and

8
00:00:24,003 --> 00:00:25,791
put the Chopper token in the Atrium.

9
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:29,789
The Savior is a teenager the fate of humanity depends on.

10
00:00:29,789 --> 00:00:31,635
If he dies, you lose immediately.

11
00:00:31,855 --> 00:00:36,004
He's the Killer's primary target: whenever an Enemy would target you, it targets him

12
00:00:36,004 --> 00:00:36,399
instead.

13
00:00:36,619 --> 00:00:39,062
He counts as an Ally, so the Ally rules apply.

14
00:00:39,062 --> 00:00:41,824
And in the Panic phase he panics just like a Victim.

15
00:00:42,633 --> 00:00:45,833
He doesn't trust you yet. His Trust level decides what he'll do.

16
00:00:46,053 --> 00:00:48,544
At Go to Hell! he won't use any Ally actions.

17
00:00:48,544 --> 00:00:53,192
At Eat Me he'll use the bottom two: Recover, and his Reaction that reduces damage by

18
00:00:53,192 --> 00:00:53,413
one.

19
00:00:53,633 --> 00:00:57,300
At I Guess You're OK, the bottom four, adding two Move one space actions.

20
00:00:57,300 --> 00:01:01,470
At I Believe You! he'll use all of them, including his attack, and only then can he

21
00:01:01,470 --> 00:01:02,273
leave the board.

22
00:01:03,100 --> 00:01:05,356
Raise Trust with the Build Trust Action card.

23
00:01:05,356 --> 00:01:08,113
You must be in his space, and it costs two Time to buy.

24
00:01:08,333 --> 00:01:12,745
The best result raises Trust by two; the next two results raise it by one, one of

25
00:01:12,745 --> 00:01:15,686
them costing a Time; and the worst costs you two Time.

26
00:01:15,686 --> 00:01:18,137
Moving up the Trust card is increasing Trust;

27
00:01:18,137 --> 00:01:20,643
effects that decrease it move the marker down.

28
00:01:21,467 --> 00:01:25,370
While he's in play, draw a Savior card each Upkeep and resolve the row for his

29
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,272
current Trust level, until he leaves or the deck runs out.

30
00:01:28,492 --> 00:01:32,480
For example, You're Not the Boss of Me!: at I Believe You! you move him up to two

31
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:36,172
spaces any way you like. At Go to Hell! he runs three spaces away from you.

32
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:40,796
When his Trust is at I Believe You! and he's on an exit, he may leave the board

33
00:01:40,796 --> 00:01:41,949
during the Action phase.

34
00:01:42,169 --> 00:01:46,569
You immediately get every unclaimed Victim reward on your Final Girl card and flip

35
00:01:46,569 --> 00:01:50,916
it, unlocking your Ultimate Ability. If it's already flipped, take the Additional

36
00:01:50,916 --> 00:01:52,687
Victims Saved reward three times.

37
00:01:52,907 --> 00:01:56,235
After that, Enemies target you again, and the game ends normally.

38
00:01:57,067 --> 00:02:01,325
To use one of his actions, put an Action cube on the leftmost box of that row.

39
00:02:01,325 --> 00:02:03,728
A row that already has a cube can't be used.

40
00:02:03,728 --> 00:02:06,075
Each Upkeep, slide all cubes one box right;

41
00:02:06,075 --> 00:02:08,587
when one drops off, that action is free again.

42
00:02:08,807 --> 00:02:12,806
Actions are for the Action phase. The blue Reaction can be used in any phase, in

43
00:02:12,806 --> 00:02:13,905
response to an attack.

44
00:02:14,125 --> 00:02:18,134
When you share a space with an Ally and one of you is attacked, you choose who takes

45
00:02:18,134 --> 00:02:21,379
it. He doesn't follow you, can't carry Items and can't save Victims.

46
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:25,136
Spaces with this icon are Railings, around the Food Court.

47
00:02:25,136 --> 00:02:27,768
White arrows show which way you can move along them.

48
00:02:27,988 --> 00:02:32,406
While moving, you or an Ally can jump from a Railing to the Food Court space beside

49
00:02:32,406 --> 00:02:34,907
it. Roll a die: on five or six you land safely;

50
00:02:34,907 --> 00:02:38,420
on one to four you lose one health. Victims won't follow you over.

51
00:02:38,640 --> 00:02:43,118
Enemies never jump down by choice. But if an effect pushes Enemies or Victims down,

52
00:02:43,118 --> 00:02:45,168
including panic, they lose one health.

53
00:02:45,388 --> 00:02:49,745
Anyone damaged on a Railing is knocked over into the Food Court below, taking one

54
00:02:49,745 --> 00:02:54,156
extra damage. And from the Food Court, ranged weapons can't target Railing spaces.

55
00:02:54,967 --> 00:02:59,565
There are six stores: Military Surplus 'R Us, Boards 'N Bones, Zap Shack, Joystick

56
00:02:59,565 --> 00:03:02,369
Heroes, Stan's Sporting Goods and Smokin' Subject.

57
00:03:02,589 --> 00:03:06,807
Anyone damaged in a store is knocked through an eligible wall of your choice into

58
00:03:06,807 --> 00:03:08,994
the space beyond, taking one extra damage.

59
00:03:08,994 --> 00:03:11,805
Put a Destroyed Wall token there: it's now an opening.

60
00:03:12,025 --> 00:03:16,427
An eligible wall is a solid one between two spaces, with no opening or token.

61
00:03:16,427 --> 00:03:19,513
If none are left, the store works like a normal space.

62
00:03:20,333 --> 00:03:24,653
Watch for Lockdown!: both exits are sealed and nobody can be saved or leave until

63
00:03:24,653 --> 00:03:28,120
you end an Action phase in Security, removing the Lockdown token.

64
00:03:28,340 --> 00:03:32,641
Bart the Mall Cop wanders round the Food Court costing you two Time when you share a

65
00:03:32,641 --> 00:03:36,276
space. Busted Escalators charges two Time to move through an escalator.

66
00:03:36,496 --> 00:03:40,960
And the Twisted Bond Minor Dark Power drags the Savior one space towards the Killer

67
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:41,659
every Upkeep.

68
00:03:42,467 --> 00:03:46,526
A few tips. The Killer heads straight for the Savior, so reach him fast and Build

69
00:03:46,526 --> 00:03:50,485
Trust before moving him to an exit. A Walkie-Talkie lets you Build Trust from a

70
00:03:50,485 --> 00:03:50,936
distance.

71
00:03:51,156 --> 00:03:54,804
Getting him out flips your Ultimate at once, even with no other saves.

72
00:03:55,024 --> 00:03:58,507
And Enemies won't jump the railings, so jumping is a great escape.

73
00:03:58,507 --> 00:03:59,035
Good luck.

